+redistributing the study files. [RAW](RAW.zip) preserves the isolated old helper
+bodies, control/observer source and both RED/GREEN process histories. Only the
+new scalar/list controls executed; no original study or suite was imported.
+[RAW-MEMBERS](RAW-MEMBERS.json) binds each member to its original path.
